{
  "id": "1CO.6",
  "number": "6",
  "bookId": "1CO",
  "reference": "1 Kor 6",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CO 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Luk kam ji̱ kɔaar Yecu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi te raan kä yɛ kɛ gak kɛ däman, la yɛn a go̱o̱r ni naŋdɛ guäth luɔ̱k nhiam nɛɛni tin thil cuŋ, kä naŋdɛ nhiam nɛɛni tin ci Kuoth kɛ lɛy? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuecɛ jɛ ɛn ɣöö bi nɛy tin ca lɛy ɣɔw luk? Kä mi bi yɛn ɣɔw luk, /cia ro̱ŋ kɛ luɔ̱k kä tin tɔatni? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/Cia jɛ ŋäc ɛn ɣöö banɛ ja̱a̱k nhial luk? Kä derɛ kulɛ te i̱di kɛ nyin teekä mɛmɛ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi ta̱yɛ kɛ go̱o̱nyni ti ce̱tkɛ tɔ̱tɔ̱, ɛ bia naath ku kuany ti bikɛ luk nɛy ti thil luɔt rɛy duëël Kuɔth? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɣän latdä mɛmɛ kɛ kui̱ po̱cädun. Kɛ thuɔ̱k ɛpuc, te rɛydun kɛ ram mi pɛl, mi dee ruac ŋok kam Krith-cini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä duundɛ ɣöö la raan Yecu däman a naŋ guäth luɔ̱k, ala yɛn mɛmɛ a lät nhiam nɛɛni tin thil ŋa̱th!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ thuɔ̱k mi ta̱yɛ kɛ go̱o̱nyni kamnikun nyoothɛ ni ɣöö ca yɛ tiam. /Ci ŋua̱n ni ɣöö ba yɛ dui̱rikä? /Ci ŋua̱n ni ɣöö ba yɛ mac? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä yɛn pua̱nykun la̱tdɛ dueer kä macɛ naath, a cäŋɛ ni dämuɔɔrikun rɛy Kritho!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä /cia jɛ ŋäc ɛn ɣöö ji̱ dueeri /cikɛ ciëŋ kuäärä Kuɔth bi jek? A yɛ /ca mɛt ɛ raan. Nɛy tin lër, tin pa̱a̱l kuthni baaŋ, tin dhööm, wutni tin kɔarkɛ rɔ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nɛy tin kuëël, tin ji̱ da̱r, tin la yɔ̱a̱ŋ kɔaaŋni, tin ji̱ kueethä, tin la ma̱a̱c nath, kɛn tɔ̱tɔ̱ /ca ciëŋ kuäärä Kuɔth bi jek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä tha̱a̱ŋkun ce̱tkɛ kɛ nɛy ɛ tɔ̱. Kä duundɛ ɣöö ca yɛ lak, ca yɛ jak kä gɔaa ci Kuoth yɛ lɛy, kä ca yɛ moc cuɔ̱ɔ̱ŋ kɛ ciöt Kua̱r ni Yecu Kritho kɛnɛ rɛy Yieekä Kuɔthdan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Liakɛ Kuoth kɛ pua̱nykun kɛnɛ Yiëë",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dee raan wee i̱, “Ŋɔaani diaal luɔtkɛ rɔ̱ kɛ ɣä,” kä duundɛ ɣöö /ciɛ ŋɔak diaal gɔw rɔ̱ kɛ ji̱ mɔ. “Ŋɔaani diaal luɔtkɛ rɔ̱ kɛ ɣä,” kä duundɛ ɣöö thilɛ mi bi ɣä jakä kuanydɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä dee raan wee i̱, “Mi̱eth lotdɛ ni jic, kä jic lotdɛ ni mi̱eth,” kä bi Kuoth kɛnɛ da̱ŋ rɛw däk. Kä puɔ̱ny /cɛ lot ni leer, lotdɛ ni Kuäär, kä Kuäär lotdɛ ni puɔ̱ny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuoth cɛ Kuäär ni Yecu jiɛc li̱th, kä kɛ buɔ̱mdɛ bɛ kɔn jiɛc li̱th bä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/Cia jɛ ŋäc ɛn ɣöö pua̱nykun kɛ cuŋ pua̱a̱ny Kritho? Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ bä cuŋ Kritho ka̱n kä bäkɛ jakä cuŋ leerä? Ëëy! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuecɛ jɛ ɛn ɣöö ram mi ci rɔ mat kɛ ler bɛ a puɔ̱ny kɛl kɛ jɛ? Kɛ ɣöö ca jɛ lar i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6:16",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Tuk 2:24.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Kɛn da̱ŋ rɛw bikɛ a puɔ̱ny kɛl.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ram mi ca mat kɛ Kuäär bɛ a yiëë kɛl kɛ jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yiënɛ rɔ̱ kä leer! Dueer diaal kɔ̱kiɛn tin lät raan kɛ tekɛ raar pua̱ny, kä duundɛ ɣöö ram mi duer kɛ leer dui̱r ni puɔ̱nydɛ duer pa̱ny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiɛ kuecɛ jɛ ɛn ɣöö puɔ̱nydun ɛ jɛn duel in cieŋ Yiëë in Gɔaa in Rɛl Rɔ thi̱n rɛydun, min ca ka̱m yɛ ɛ Kuoth? Yɛn, /ci yɛn la nyin pua̱nynikun, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ ɣöö ca yɛ kɔk kɛ ko̱k. Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ liakɛ Kuoth kɛ pua̱nykun.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
